# Sprint 7 — Skills Page

**Goal:** Build the full Skills page. This page covers design tools,
design skills, and most importantly the spec-driven AI workflow —
which is a core part of the IS117 assignment requirements.

**Reference:** docs/specs/spec-foundation.md sections 4 and 5

