## Tasks

1. Build the skills hero section

   Container: max-width var(--max-width), margin auto, padding 0 2rem
   Section padding: 6rem 0 4rem

   Label:
   - Text: "Skills"
   - IBM Plex Sans, 11px, uppercase, letter-spacing 0.12em,
     weight 500, color var(--muted), margin-bottom 1.5rem

   Statement:
   - Text: "I'm learning deliberately — one tool, one concept,
     one decision at a time."
   - Font: DM Sans, clamp(1.6rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem), weight 500
   - Letter-spacing: -0.02em, line-height: 1.15
   - Color: var(--text)
   - Max-width: 700px

2. Build the design tools section

   Border-top: 0.5px solid var(--border)
   Padding: 5rem 0

   Label: "Design tools"

   Each tool item:
   - Layout: flex column
   - Padding: 0.75rem 0
   - Border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--border)
   - Max-width: 560px

   Tool name:
   - IBM Plex Sans, 14px, weight 500, color var(--text)

   Tool description:
   - IBM Plex Sans, 13px, color var(--muted), margin-top 0.2rem

   Items:
   - Figma — "UI design, component building, prototyping"
   - FigJam — "User flows and journey mapping"
   - Miro — "Research synthesis and ideation"

3. Build the design skills section

   Border-top: 0.5px solid var(--border)
   Padding: 5rem 0

   Label: "Design skills"

   Same item structure as design tools. Max-width: 560px.

   Items:
   - User research — "Identifying real problems through observation
     and lived experience"
   - Wireframing — "Translating ideas into structure before aesthetics"
   - UX writing — "Clear, human language inside interfaces"
   - Case study writing — "Documenting design decisions and reasoning"

4. Build the AI workflow section

   Border-top: 0.5px solid var(--border)
   Padding: 5rem 0

   Label:
   - Text: "AI workflow"
   - Color: var(--blue)

   H2: "Spec-driven development."
   - DM Sans, 1.5rem, weight 500, letter-spacing -0.02em
   - Margin-bottom: 1rem

   Body:
   - Text: "A workflow where I write the detailed spec, AI builds
     from it, and I review, revise, and redirect. The decisions
     are mine. The reasoning is mine. AI handles execution so I
     can stay focused on judgment."
   - IBM Plex Sans, 15px, color var(--muted), line-height 1.85
   - Max-width: 580px
   - Margin-bottom: 1.5rem

   Quote block:
   - Background: var(--blue-light)
   - Border-radius: 10px
   - Padding: 1.5rem 2rem
   - Max-width: 580px
   - Text: "I use AI as a junior developer and writing partner,
     not a replacement for thinking. I plan first, spec second,
     prompt third — and I treat every output as a draft that
     needs my editorial eye before it's real."
   - IBM Plex Sans, 14px, color var(--blue-dark), line-height 1.8

